 ('orange', ['Magnitogorsk', 'Steel Works'], 200, [20, 80, 220, 600, 800, 1000], 'First we built the furnaces. Housing is scheduled for a later plan.', 'A steel city raised from empty steppe starting in 1929, modeled on the mills of Gary, Indiana.'),
