 ('yellow', ['Gosplan'], 260, [20, 110, 330, 800, 980, 1150], 'We have calculated exactly how many left boots the nation needs. Right boots come next year.', 'Gosplan: the State Planning Committee, which wrote the Five-Year Plans.'),
